where \eqn{\mathcal{M}_{v,l}} is the set of selected models contributing to
a given variable/lag combination.

The relative lag contribution is computed as:

\deqn{
RI_{\mathrm{ens},l} =
100 \times
\frac{|C_{\mathrm{ens},l}|}
{\sum_l |C_{\mathrm{ens},l}|}
